{"id":"935ae20b7597689e","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-semantic-godel-sentence.md","title":"Semantic Gödel Sentence for a Set","display":"df-semantic-godel-sentence — Semantic Gödel Sentence for a Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-semantic-godel-sentence","aliases":["92-df-semantic-godel-sentence"],"display":"df-semantic-godel-sentence — Semantic Gödel Sentence for a Set","source":"第 I 章 p. 8；第 VIII 章 p. 103（PDF 25、120）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-semantic-godel-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-semantic-godel-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-semantic-godel-sentence — Semantic Gödel Sentence for a Set"},{"key":"source","html":"第 I 章 p. 8；第 VIII 章 p. 103（PDF 25、120）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1edb9c65c85c539f\" href=\"?note=1edb9c65c85c539f\" title=\"92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language\">92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)\">\\(\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in S\">\\(X\\in S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SemGdl}_{\\mathcal L}\\subseteq S\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\mathrm{SemGdl}_{\\mathcal L}\\subseteq S\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span> 是下文定义的语义关系。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semantic\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SemGdl}_{\\mathcal L}(X,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(X\\in T\\Longleftrightarrow g(X)\\in A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semantic\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SemGdl}_{\\mathcal L}(X,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(X\\in T\\Longleftrightarrow g(X)\\in A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是第 I、II 章针对任意集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的语义定义。它不要求系统证明一个双条件，也不限于“不可证性”。第 VIII 章的内部固定点更强；第 IX 章通常取不可证码集，才得到惯常的 Gödel 句。三种层级必须区别。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 I 章 p. 8；第 VIII 章 p. 103（PDF 25、120）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language","status":"resolved","id":"1edb9c65c85c539f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-incompleteness-language]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SemGdl}_{\\mathcal L}\\subseteq S\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semantic\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SemGdl}_{\\mathcal L}(X,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(X\\in T\\Longleftrightarrow g(X)\\in A).","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1314,"backlinks":[{"id":"2ae549c14f89182f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ced07f0d506d2066","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这一固定点是 $G$ 证明双条件的句法固定点。原书较早的语义 Lemma D 不给该内部证明；其真值定义见[[92-df-semantic-godel-sentence]]。源书 Theorem 4 的充分条件是对角函数强可定义，本地 Q 强度条件通过明确的图公式与自引用构造实现。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-81","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-semantic-godel-sentence]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-155","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-semantic-godel-sentence]]"}],"outgoing":["1edb9c65c85c539f"]}